/* ============================================================================
   CINEMACITY · SOCIAL MEDIA STRATEGY 2026–27
   content.js — EDITABLE STRATEGIC CONTENT
   ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   This is the only file you need to touch to update the strategy's data.
   Nothing here knows anything about layout. Everything is rendered by app.js.

   HOW TO ADD VIDEOS
     Find the pillar in PILLARS[] and edit its `videos` array.
     `driveUrl` accepts ANY of these three Google Drive forms:
        https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILE_ID/view?usp=sharing
        https://drive.google.com/open?id=FILE_ID
        https://drive.google.com/file/d/FILE_ID/preview
     They are all normalised to an embeddable /preview URL automatically.
     Leave the ALL_CAPS placeholder strings in place until a real asset exists —
     the layout is designed to look finished while they are still there.

   HOW TO ADD DESIGN EXAMPLES
     Edit VISUAL_SYSTEM_EXAMPLES[]. Set `assetUrl` to an image or video URL.
     `aspectRatio` drives the frame, so 9:16, 4:5, 1:1 and 16:9 all sit
     correctly side by side without cropping. No layout changes required.

   EVIDENCE DISCIPLINE
     Every data point carries a `source` and every claim carries a `tier`:
        'observed'  — we saw it directly, on the stated date
        'reported'  — published by a named third party
        'client'    — from Cinemacity's own reporting
        'hypothesis'— our inference, requires validation
        'todo'      — awaiting client data. Never invent a number here.
   ========================================================================= */

